    "The exception sets memory_sample_unavailable immediately; the last_memory_sentinel_sample is the last earlier successful sample retained for diagnostics and was not used as a replacement for the missing counter.",
    "Only after the refusal does stop_process poll/wait and obtain terminal returncode0 and empty owned-group cleanup. That later returncode cannot establish the child was already nonrunning at the three observations.",
    "The preceding unfix-audit shows bounded transient missing reads followed by a fresh complete empty census; the adapter already handles an actually observed disappearance without fabricating RSS.",
    "This evidence supports an exit-transition hypothesis but does not establish a kernel cause or validate changing the existing resource policy. Raw kernel task flags/mm state and runner kernel identity were not authenticated.",
